    "updated_at": "2025-07-22T14:59:24Z",
    "body": "Thinking about this some more, I wonder if we can pave the cowpaths and just use `size`, as @josepharhar proposed. Then all we need is a way for authors to make the control a listbox without enforcing a specific height. `size=\"auto\"`?",
